# Code Block Options

## Basic code block

```python
def hello(name):
    print(f"Hello, {name}!")
```

## JavaScript

```javascript
const greet = (name) => {
    console.log("Hello, " + name + "!");
};
greet("World");
```

## Bash

```bash
npm install markup-plus-js
mup-js hello.mup
```

## JSON

```json
{
  "name": "markup-plus-js",
  "version": "0.6.4"
}
```

## HTML

```html
<div class="example">
  <p>Hello</p>
</div>
```

## CSS

```css
.button {
  background: #667eea;
  color: white;
  border-radius: 8px;
}
```
